=== Plan B sizing (NATIVE format) ===
  median routed-expert bytes per full layer: 7.219 GB
  per-expert (w1+w3+w2)                   : 18.80 MB
  x 40 layers                            : 288.78 GB  <- all routed experts, one rank

  Per TOKEN the model makes 40 layers x 6 picks = 240 expert-selections.
  Cold bytes/token = selections x miss_rate x per_expert_bytes.
  Worst case (every pick cold): 4.51 GB/token.

  resident fraction at 95 GB of experts: 32.9%
  i.e. ~126 of 384 experts per layer

  COLD-MISS BYTES/TOKEN vs LRU HIT RATE at that resident set
  (a MISS is a pick landing on a non-resident expert):

