  PLAN B's BAR: to beat 25 tok/s the SSD ceiling needs
  < 260.0 MB/token  =>  hit rate > 94.2% at the resident set above.

  So Plan B lives or dies on ROUTING CONCENTRATION: what share of
  picks land on the resident experts. Uniform routing would give
  hit_rate=0.329 (32.9%) -> 3.03 GB/token -> 2.1 tok/s = DEAD.
  Real MoE routing is Zipf-like; the actual concentration must be
  MEASURED from a routing trace (see p8b).
